Package: AvianEchoR
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Acoustic Analysis and Classification of Bird Calls
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Naina Bhalla [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Naina Bhalla <nainab24@iitk.ac.in>
Description: A comprehensive statistical pipeline for ornithological acoustic analysis.
  This package processes raw bioacoustic recordings into a 15-dimensional hybrid 
  feature space using Functional Principal Component Analysis (fPCA) on pitch 
  trajectories and discrete spectral properties. It provides robust dimensionality 
  reduction (PCA, t-SNE, UMAP) and employs a Distance-Weighted k-Nearest Neighbors 
  (kNN) algorithm with stratified cross-validation for species classification. 
  Features an interactive Shiny dashboard for live inference and visualization.
